-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-[#f7f4ed] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-amber-200/70 p-5 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-amber-300 transition\"><div><div class=\"relative aspect-video w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 mb-4\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ\" title=\"The Future of Quranic Manuscript Studies\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowFullScreen=\"\"></iframe></div><span class=\"text-[#0c3823] text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase block mb-1\">KEYNOTE ADDRESS</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 leading-snug mb-2\">The Future of Quranic Manuscript Studies</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Keynote presentation delivered at Radcliffe Hall, Oxford, detailing advanced multispectral imaging.</p></div><div class=\"pt-3 border-t border-amber-200/40 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\"><span>February 2024</span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-800 hover:underline font-bold\"><span>Watch Source</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#f7f4ed] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-amber-200/70 p-5 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-amber-300 transition\"><div><div class=\"relative aspect-video w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 mb-4\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ\" title=\"Digital Codicology Best Practices Workshop\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowFullScreen=\"\"></iframe></div><span class=\"text-[#0c3823] text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase block mb-1\">LECTURES</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 leading-snug mb-2\">Digital Codicology Best Practices Workshop</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">A technical seminar on digital cataloging standards for early Hijazi parchments.</p></div><div class=\"pt-3 border-t border-amber-200/40 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\"><span>Jan 18, 2024</span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-800 hover:underline font-bold\"><span>Watch Source</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#f7f4ed] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-amber-200/70 p-5 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-amber-300 transition\"><div><div class=\"relative aspect-video w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 mb-4\"><iframe src=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/ExamplePost/\" title=\"Preserving Ancient Hijazi Parchments\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowFullScreen=\"\"></iframe></div><span class=\"text-[#0c3823] text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase block mb-1\">DOCUMENTARY</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 leading-snug mb-2\">Preserving Ancient Hijazi Parchments</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Documentary footage highlighting the conservation lab at the Kerala main campus.</p></div><div class=\"pt-3 border-t border-amber-200/40 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\"><span>Dec 05, 2023</span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/ExamplePost/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-800 hover:underline font-bold\"><span>Watch Source</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"conference-gallery\" class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-16 pt-16 md:pt-20\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-[#0c3823]\"></span><span class=\"text-[#0c3823] text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\">ACADEMIC SYMPOSIUM</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 font-light mb-3\">Conference Gallery</h2><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-normal\">Annual events focusing on classical exegesis frameworks, translation methodologies, and codicological cataloging.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"relative aspect-16/10 w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-100 mb-5\"><img alt=\"3rd International Symposium on Tafsir Studies\" load