shrink-0\"><img alt=\"Traditional Codicology vs. Digital Humanities\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Flec-digital.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Flec-digital.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Flec-digital.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Flec-digital.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Flec-digital.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Flec-digital.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Flec-digital.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Flec-digital.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Flec-digital.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 leading-snug\">Traditional Codicology vs. Digital Humanities</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Dr. G. Sterling</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1\"><span>January 14, 2024</span><span class=\"text-amber-800 font-bold\">1:32:10</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"mb-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-[#0c3823]\"></span><span class=\"text-[#0c3823] text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\">CONVERSATIONS</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-slate-800 font-light\">Interviews</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"bg-[#f7f4ed] p-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200/60 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"relative w-16 h-16 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-200 shrink-0\"><img alt=\"Preserving Quranic Manuscripts: A Life&#x27;s Work\" loading=