&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-mitchell.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-mitchell.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-mitchell.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-mitchell.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-mitchell.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 leading-snug\">Bilateral Codicology: Oxford &amp; India</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Interview with Dr. Sarah Mitchell</p><span class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 block mt-1\">February 04, 2024</span></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#f7f4ed] p-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200/60 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"relative w-16 h-16 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-200 shrink-0\"><img alt=\"The Digital Library: Access and Preservation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-yilmaz.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-yilmaz.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-yilmaz.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-yilmaz.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-yilmaz.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-yilmaz.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-yilmaz.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-yilmaz.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmedia%2Fint-yilmaz.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-serif font-medium text-slate-800 leading-snug\">The Digital Library: Access and Preservation</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Interview with Dr. H. Yilmaz</p><span class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 block mt-1\">December 18, 2023</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"press-coverage\" class=\"w-full bg-[#121714] text-white py-16 px-6 md:px-16 mt-20\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-emerald-500\"></span><span class=\"text-emerald-400 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\">GLOBAL RECOGNITION</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-light text-white mb-3\">Press Coverage</h2><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 font-light\">How international and regional media outlets report on IRITAQ&#x27;s academic milestones and global partnerships.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-[#1b221e] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-emerald-800 transition\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-3\"><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">Al Jazeera</span><span class=\"text-slate-500 text-[11px]\">February 15, 2024</span></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-serif text-white leading-snug mb-3\">IRITAQ Kerala Unveils Digital Codicology Lab to Scan Early Quran Manuscripts</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-6\">The newly opened state-of-the-art laboratory features multispectral imaging capabilities.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-800\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors\"><span>Read Coverage</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#1b221e] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-emerald-800 transition\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-3\"><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">Gulf News</span><span class=\"text-slate-500 text-[11px]\">November 12, 2023</span></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-serif text-white leading-snug mb-3\">Strategic Partnership Signed Between Oxford and India&#x27;s Premier Tafsir Institute</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Dignitaries from both seats of learning ratified agreements to exchange visiting scholars.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-800\"><a href=\"https://gulfnews.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors\"><span>Read Coverage</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#1b221e] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-emerald-800 transition\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-3\"><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">The National</span><span class=\"text-slate-500 text-[11px]\">September 05, 2023</span></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-serif text-white leading-snug mb-3\">How Traditional Exegesis Meets Modern Digital Preservation in Kerala</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Scholars at the institute ensure that contemporary technology serves traditional theological frameworks.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-800\"><a href=\"https://www.thenationalnews.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors\"><span>Read Coverage</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#1b221e] rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-emerald-800 transition\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-3\"><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">Arab News</span><span class=\"text-slate-500 text-[11px]\">July 20, 2023</span></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-serif text-white leading-snug mb-3\">IRITAQ Announces Global Academic Conference on Manuscript Codicology</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Exegesis researchers and digital library coordinators from ten countries are expected to convene.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-slate-800\"><a href=\"https://www.arabnews.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors\"><span>Read Coverage</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"w-full bg-[#111613] text-[#cfd4cf] font-sans border-t border-[#1e2520]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-16 pt-16 pb-12\"><di